# #5837, F2' (a5e2e2ef, #5837 comment 6654962443): a forward chain's stamp carries every
# forwarder on it, up to k, each attributed under the empty token.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestReforwardChainOverflowStamped
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a chain past k is stamped with its first k forwarders' worth of space but attributed only to its receiver, rather than going unstamped (C4)
PERTURBS: ReforwardChain
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithReforward = TRUE, WithOrphanForward = TRUE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, MaxWindows = 0

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = OrphanFwdOnly]
            /\ lastU' = next
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the overflowing chain is stamped, so it raises no shared watermark.
       ELSE /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = OrphanFwdOnly]
            /\ UNCHANGED lastU
--- END
